# Brand artwork is delivered by the business and must survive a round-trip through git
# byte-for-byte. Without this, a checkout on Windows rewrites the line endings inside
# makam-logo.svg — the artwork still renders, but the file is no longer the file that was
# supplied, and the size assertion in tests/brand-migration.test.tsx would fail on a fresh
# clone while passing here. `binary` marks these as untouchable: no eol conversion, no
# diffing them as text.
public/brand/*.svg binary
public/brand/*.png binary
